                  Parameters for VMODEL
                  *********************

START OF PARAMETERS:
vmodel.var   \file for variogram output
2 30   \number of directions and lags
45 0 0.5   \azm, dip, lag distance
0 30 1   \azm, dip, lag distance
1 0   \nst, nugget effect
2 1 0 0 0   \it,cc,ang1,ang2,ang3
12 12 12   \a_hmax, a_hmin, a_vert
